<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n18799" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">frīgĭdārĭus</span></b> , a,
			um, adj.
		frigidus, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>of</i> or <i>for cooling</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ahenum,</span>”
				i. e. <i>to hold cold water</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Vitr.
					5, 10</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">cella balinei,</span>”
				<i>the coolingroom</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Plin. Ep. 2, 17, 11</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">5, 6, 25</span></i>
			sq.: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">maltha,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Pall. 1, 41</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">fistula,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. 1, 40</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">cisterna,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Petr. 73</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<i>Subst.</i>: <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">frīgĭdārium</span></b> ,
			ii, n.
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>A.</b>
			
			<i>The cooling-room</i> in a bath, <i><span class="en">Vitr. 5,
			11</span></i>.— </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>B.</b>
			In a contr. form: <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">frigdāria</span></b> , ōrum, <i>a cold larder</i>, <i>provision-room</i>: mercem in frigdaria ferre, Lucil. ap.
					<i><span class="en">Prisc. p. 909</span></i> P.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
